# Knowledge graph: commit graph.json only. GRAPH_REPORT.md is clustering-path-only
# output (`graphify update --no-cluster` never writes it), every regen PR here is
# single-file, and the regen job's `git add` of a missing file aborts under
# set -euo pipefail — an allow-list entry it can never satisfy is a trap.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
pub-scrub-check/
